       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRANSACTION-SUMMARY.
      * A reference batch program matching the local regression fixture.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT TRANSACTION-FILE ASSIGN TO INPUTDD.
           SELECT SUMMARY-FILE ASSIGN TO OUTPUTDD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  TRANSACTION-FILE.
       01  TRANSACTION-RECORD.
           COPY TRANSACTION.
       FD  SUMMARY-FILE.
       01  SUMMARY-RECORD PIC X(80).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  EOF-FLAG PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           88 END-OF-FILE VALUE 'Y'.
       01  TRANSACTION-COUNT PIC 9(10) VALUE ZERO.
       01  TOTAL-CENTS PIC 9(10) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT TRANSACTION-FILE OUTPUT SUMMARY-FILE
           PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE
               READ TRANSACTION-FILE
                   AT END SET END-OF-FILE TO TRUE
                   NOT AT END
                       ADD 1 TO TRANSACTION-COUNT
                       ADD TRANSACTION-AMOUNT-CENTS TO TOTAL-CENTS
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM
           MOVE SPACES TO SUMMARY-RECORD
           STRING 'TRANSACTION-COUNT ' TRANSACTION-COUNT
               DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO SUMMARY-RECORD
           WRITE SUMMARY-RECORD
           MOVE SPACES TO SUMMARY-RECORD
           STRING 'TOTAL-CENTS      ' TOTAL-CENTS
               DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO SUMMARY-RECORD
           WRITE SUMMARY-RECORD
           CLOSE TRANSACTION-FILE SUMMARY-FILE
           GOBACK.
